{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Divine Demon Martial Saint&quot; is a simulation management game full of ancient charm, taking you to experience ancient officialdom and court life immersively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can start from a relatively low official rank and gradually climb up through the &quot;Promotion&quot; system, enjoying the fun of career advancement. You can participate in &quot;Choosing a Concubine&quot; to add color to your court life; you can also seek &quot;Artifacts&quot; to help your better development in officialdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game has rich systems such as &quot;National Policies&quot;, &quot;Antiques&quot;, &quot;Gardens&quot;, &quot;Cities&quot;, and &quot;Territories&quot;. You can formulate national policies to govern regions, collect antiques to enhance cultural heritage, build exquisite gardens and cities, and continuously expand your territory to build your own ancient dynasty world. At the same time, there are also welfare and convenient functions such as &quot;Sign-in Gifts&quot;, &quot;Automatic Click&quot;, and &quot;N-fold Income&quot; to make your gaming experience smoother.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044860?t=1758767635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044860/ca2c09fc92a2174bc31ab10337615e6bbe7b80c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758767635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044860/06d2392eee696cfe46ad00ceb72bcf7f961f8c52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758767635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044860/06d2392eee696cfe46ad00ceb72bcf7f961f8c52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758767635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Divine Demon Martial Saint&quot; is a simulation management game full of ancient charm, taking you to experience ancient officialdom and court life immersively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can start from a relatively low official rank and gradually climb up through the &quot;Promotion&quot; system, enjoying the fun of career advancement. You can participate in &quot;Choosing a Concubine&quot; to add color to your court life; you can also seek &quot;Artifacts&quot; to help your better development in officialdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the game has rich systems such as &quot;National Policies&quot;, &quot;Antiques&quot;, &quot;Gardens&quot;, &quot;Cities&quot;, and &quot;Territories&quot;. You can formulate national policies to govern regions, collect antiques to enhance cultural heritage, build exquisite gardens and cities, and continuously expand your territory to build your own ancient dynasty world. At the same time, there are also welfare and convenient functions such as &quot;Sign-in Gifts&quot;, &quot;Automatic Click&quot;, and &quot;N-fold Income&quot; to make your gaming experience smoother.</p>","developers":["\u795e\u9b54\u6b66\u5723"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044860/01911c405ce83ff8dde978eb38def9919adabc1b/header.jpg?t=1758767635","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4044860/971706593/842ae4601bf1ae16a64c8e46bcc8c494c9244163/1758253999/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758767633","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steams